tuxtoys (0.3.0~dev) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * MintToys is now TuxToys: the package, its commands, its settings folder
    and its application ID carry the new name.
  * New+ adds New from template to Nemo's right-click menu: files and
    folders from your templates, with variables in their names and the
    templates ordered by a leading number.
  * Image Resizer resizes pictures from Nemo's right-click menu, to sizes
    of your choosing, as PowerToys' Image Resizer does.
  * Rename+ renames many files and folders at once from Nemo, with search
    and replace, regular expressions, counters, dates and a preview, as
    PowerToys' PowerRename does. It can also take over Nemo's Rename.
  * Hosts File Editor edits /etc/hosts in a window, as PowerToys' Hosts
    File Editor does, saving through pkexec with a backup first.
  * The settings window opens on Home, with a General page beside it: the
    version and links, the panel icon on or off, and a backup of every
    tool's settings to restore later or elsewhere.

 -- Kōnabe Studio <konabe@proton.me>  Mon, 12 Oct 2026 14:23:10 +0200

minttoys (0.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Four new tools: Light Switch switches the desktop between Linux Mint's
    day and dark modes on a schedule; Always on Top keeps a window above
    the others, framed; File Locksmith shows which processes hold a file
    open; New+ manages the templates of Nemo's Create New Document.
  * A settings window with a sidebar and an Overview of every tool.
  * Awake shows its mode in the panel icon.

 -- Kōnabe Studio <konabe@proton.me>  Mon, 12 Oct 2026 14:05:00 +0200

minttoys (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First release: Awake keeps the computer awake until it is turned off,
    for a set time, or until a time of day, without changing the power
    settings. With a panel icon, a settings window and the minttoys
    command, in English and Hungarian.

 -- Kōnabe Studio <konabe@proton.me>  Fri, 09 Oct 2026 13:20:00 +0200
